  "patthana12.15:0.1": "",
  "patthana12.15:0.2": "",
  "patthana12.15:0.3": "100-7-13. Saraṇaduka-cūḷantaradukāni ",
  "patthana12.15:1.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naasaṅkhataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:2.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nasanidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:3.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nasappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:4.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:5.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ narūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:6.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naarūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:7.1": "",
  "patthana12.15:8.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nalokuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.15:9.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nakenaci viññeyyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ nanakenaci viññeyyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. "
}
